{"4359020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lost Hope", "steam_appid": 4359020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359020/extras/6bebea92133cb1a1692d2bc9d2a14881.avif?t=1787168918\" width=800 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Lost</strong> <strong>Hope</strong> is a short, intense first-person horror experience set in an abandoned  hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Kidnapped by a mad scientist and hunted by his twisted monsters, you must survive and fight your way out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359020/extras/868f5297e84cf99160a322e5e4921d6e.avif?t=1787168918\" width=800 height=128 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense survival horror with limited resources</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revolver and shotgun with scarce ammo</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flashlight for navigation in the dark</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Health packs to survive brutal encounters</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect notes and documents to uncover the story</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search for keys to open locked doors</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide in closets, under beds, and toilets to avoid monsters</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359020/extras/6bebea92133cb1a1692d2bc